lusion, the best move is to discard B1 to form a Mixed Straight (8 points).\n", "output": "Evaluation: The best move is to discard B1 to form a Mixed Straight with four chows and a pair in Dots and Characters, achieving 8 points.\nReason: Discarding B1 allows the hand to become a Mixed Straight (8 points) with chows in Dots (T3-4-5, T5-6-7, T7-8-9) and Characters (W5-6-7), plus a pair of T7. This is the highest-scoring valid action available.\nAnswer: Play B1"}
